        "en": "Devoted clinicians alongside reception grievances"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Numerous clients praise Dr Thorne, Dr Osadiaye, and receptionist Annabel for their compassionate care, thorough explanations, and friendly service during routine veterinary checkups. Conversely, dissatisfied pet owners report sharp contrasts, describing instances of unhelpful phone interactions, unstaffed front desks during morning drop-offs, and perceived indifference from practice management."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "results",
      "sentiment": "mixed",
      "mentions": 13,
      "title": {
        "en": "Routine preventive care with emergency concerns"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Pet parents highlight positive clinical outcomes for routine wellness treatments, dental cleanings, kennel cough management, and vaccination programmes. However, multiple critical reviews express serious concerns regarding diagnostic oversight, including disputes over suggested surgical procedures, delayed communication, and a reported refusal to triage an urgent case."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "animals",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 12,
      "title": {
        "en": "Affectionate handling for family pets"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Most pet owners appreciate that clinic staff treat dogs and cats with warmth and consideration during examination visits in Lakewood. Reviewers note that pets often remain relaxed during routine dental work and nail trims. While one owner felt their dog's quick was trimmed improperly, the majority observe caring, patient handling."
      }
    }
